      "verification_note": "Tax-General section 10-105 as amended by the Budget Reconciliation and Financing Act of 2025 (Chapter 604 / HB 352) matches the 2025 brackets, including 6.25 and 6.50 percent, and for tax years 2025 through 2028 imposes an additional 2 percent on net capital gain for individuals with federal AGI over $350,000 (exclusions in the Act are not modeled). It does not print the 2024 schedule, the standard deduction, or the personal exemption.",
